<title>USA: Provident approves stock split, ups div.</title>
<headline>Provident approves stock split, ups div.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.20		     $0.18</p>
